      },
      "worked": "The subtotals are the number of goals multiplied by the frequency.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}0\\times5 &= 0\\\\1\\times8 &= 8\\\\2\\times6 &= 12\\\\3\\times4 &= 12\\\\4\\times1 &= 4\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sum f &= 5+8+6+4+1\\\\\\sum f &= 24\\\\\\sum xf &= 0+8+12+12+4\\\\\\sum xf &= 36\\\\\\bar{x} &= \\frac{\\sum xf}{\\sum f}\\\\\\bar{x} &= \\frac{36}{24}\\\\\\bar{x} &= 1.5\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe mean is $1.5$ goals per match.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 42
